@HangfireOrderDemo_HostAddress = https://localhost:7001

### 1. Place an order. Returns at once; payment, confirmation, invoice and the
###    review reminder all run in the background.
POST {{HangfireOrderDemo_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "jane@example.com",
  "productName": "Wireless Mouse",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 2. An invalid body. The controller validates before anything is queued,
###    so this returns 400 and creates no order and no jobs.
POST {{HangfireOrderDemo_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "not-an-email",
  "productName": "",
  "quantity": 0
}

### 3. The numbers worth alerting on: queue depth, retries, and continuations
###    that are still waiting for their parent job.
GET {{HangfireOrderDemo_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/health

### 4. Queue a job that always throws, so the Retries and Failed tabs can be
###    seen without disturbing the happy path. Use the order id from step 1.
POST {{HangfireOrderDemo_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1/fail-demo

### 5. The dashboard itself is at /hangfire — open it in a browser.
GET {{HangfireOrderDemo_HostAddress}}/hangfire

###
